### Agent Award History API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/agent-award-history
@agentTrackingId = AGENT_TRACKING_ID_HERE
@awardTrackingId = AWARD_TRACKING_ID_HERE
@trackingId = RECORD_TRACKING_ID_HERE

### 1. Create new award history
POST {{baseUrl}}/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agentTrackingId": "{{agentTrackingId}}",
  "awardTrackingId": "{{awardTrackingId}}",
  "awardDate": "2024-05-15T00:00:00",
  "ceremony": "Annual Awards Ceremony 2024",
  "notes": "Awarded for outstanding service"
}

### 2. Update award history (Path Variable)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/update/{{trackingId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agentTrackingId": "{{agentTrackingId}}",
  "awardTrackingId": "{{awardTrackingId}}",
  "awardDate": "2024-05-15T00:00:00",
  "ceremony": "Annual Awards Ceremony 2024",
  "notes": "Updated notes"
}

### 3. Get specific award history record (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/get/{{trackingId}}

### 4. Get all awards for an agent (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/agent/{{agentTrackingId}}

### 5. Get history by award (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/award/{{awardTrackingId}}

### 6. Get by award date range (Path Variables)
GET {{baseUrl}}/award-date-range/2024-01-01T00:00:00/2024-12-31T23:59:59

### 7. Count awards for an agent (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/agent/{{agentTrackingId}}/count

### 8. Get all award history records
GET {{baseUrl}}/list

### 9. Delete award history record (Path Variable)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/delete/{{trackingId}}
